2%402x.png","line":19,"embedded":true},{"title":"App Clips","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppClip","line":47},{"title":"Designing your App Clip","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Designing-your-App-Clip","line":49},{"title":"Apple Pay","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay","line":69},{"title":"Sign in with Apple","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sign-in-with-apple","line":71},{"title":"Preserving privacy","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Preserving-privacy","line":75},{"title":"Choosing the right functionality for your App Clip","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppClip/choosing-the-right-functionality-for-your-app-clip","line":77},{"title":"Sign in with Apple","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sign-in-with-apple","line":81},{"title":"Apple Pay","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pay","line":83},{"title":"Showcasing your app","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Showcasing-your-app","line":85},{"title":"`SKOverlay`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/StoreKit/SKOverlay","line":102},{"title":"Recommending your app to App Clip users","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppClip/recommending-your-app-to-app-clip-users","line":106},{"title":"Limiting notifications","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Limiting-notifications","line":108},{"title":"Enabling notifications in App Clips","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppClip/enabling-notifications-in-app-clips","line":118},{"title":"Creating App Clips for businesses","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Creating-App-Clips-for-businesses","line":120},{"title":"App Store Connect","target":"https://appstoreconnect.apple.com","line":122},{"title":"Configuring App Clip experiences","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppClip/configuring-the-launch-experience-of-your-app-clip","line":128},{"title":"Creating content for an App Clip card","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Creating-content-for-an-App-Clip-card","line":130},{"title":"A horizontal row of two App Clip cards. The left App Clip card is for a game and uses Play as the verb for the action button. The right App Clip card is for an app and uses Open as the verb for the action button.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d23129c13777717e7b27c9a1e2b2f8b0/app-clips-card%402x.png","line":146,"embedded":true},{"title":"App Clip Codes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#App-Clip-Codes","line":148},{"title":"An App Clip Code that uses a badge design with the App Clip logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a5b0ac2b9f76d76391473c86a4104ef9/with-appclip-logo%402x.png","line":152,"embedded":true},{"title":"An App Clip Code that uses a design without the App Clip logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2441534012373af30bf4e6ac94bbcc20/without-appclip-logo%402x.png","line":154,"embedded":true},{"title":"Creating App Clip Codes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppClip/creating-app-clip-codes","line":156},{"title":"Interacting with App Clip Codes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Interacting-with-App-Clip-Codes","line":158},{"title":"A scan-only App Clip Code with callouts for the center icon, visual code, and the App Clip logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/3e01f3350c0634f35ba0cb54c46b4227/scan-only%402x.png","line":162,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration that shows how a person uses an App Clip Code on a table at a coffee shop. The left side of the illustration shows two people sitting at a table. A placard in the middle of the table contains an App Clip Code. The person on the left is using their camera to scan the App Clip Code. The right side of the illustration shows a zoomed-in version of the person's phone screen and the placard on the table.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/331753285f06bb59ab3bae929756a505/interacting-coffee-shop-example%402x.png","line":175,"embedded":true},{"title":"Displaying App Clip Codes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Displaying-App-Clip-Codes","line":177},{"title":"An illustration that shows a circle that represents a cylindrical surface. Lines divide the circle into six segments of equal size. One segment represents an App Clip Code and shows how the code doesn’t cover more than one-sixth, or 60 degrees, of the surface’s circumference.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5999e7c0f514a877839b74e365c8a7e2/app-clips-slice%402x.png","line":211,"embedded":true},{"title":"A correctly placed App Clip Code in the upright position.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a6eaaa833a98678b2b93f910f149bb6e/upright-display-right%402x.png","line":221,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":223,"embedded":true},{"title":"An incorrectly placed App Clip Code that's rotated 90 degrees to the left.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5897608f22eb0d296f1a8189c1f2e38b/upright-display-wrong-1%402x.png","line":225,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate an invalid App Clip Code.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":227,"embedded":true},{"title":"An incorrectly placed App Clip Code that's rotated 135 degrees to the right.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d4b3a7a3d5685fbec4194deb55bbb0c9/upright-display-wrong-2%402x.png","line":229,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate an invalid App Clip Code.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":231,"embedded":true},{"title":"An App Clip Code that uses the badge design and has a minimum diameter of 3/4 inch \\(1.9 cm\\).","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/604637e18752ed4948becd174afbc361/sizing-minimum-rectangle%402x.png","line":241,"embedded":true},{"title":"An App Clip Code that uses the design without the App Clip logo and has a minimum diameter of 3/4 inch \\(1.9 cm\\).","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0aa05fa8f03c37459ea683c058a35a2f/sizing-minimum-circular%402x.png","line":243,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an App Clip Code next to a QR code. Red guides denote that both are the same size.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b693a5616cb7a4b58895496c6b834b2d/app-clip-with-qr-code%402x.png","line":249,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration that shows an App Clip Code with the badge design to the left of an App Clip Code without the App Clip logo. A red guide surrounds each App Clip Code, illustrating the clear space requirements.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/60ce57295e138b8c399d9c229238f40d/app-clip-spacing%402x.png","line":253,"embedded":true},{"title":"Using clear messaging","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Using-clear-messaging","line":255},{"title":"An illustration that shows two people sitting at a table at a coffee shop. A placard in the middle of the table contains an App Clip Code. The right side of the illustration shows a zoomed-in version of the placard, which contains an App Clip Code and surrounding text that reads 'Place your order. Hold your iPhone near the menu to place your food order.'.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/f168bf0bd2558212caf8059de39205e5/clear-messaging%402x.png","line":259,"embedded":true},{"title":"NFC","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/nfc","line":279},{"title":"Legal requirements","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Legal-requirements","line":281},{"title":"Guidelines for Using Apple Trademarks","target":"https://www.apple.com/legal/intellectual-property/guidelinesfor3rdparties.html","line":281},{"title":"Customizing your App Clip Code","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-clips#Customizing-your-App-Clip-Code","line":283},{"title":"App Store Connect","target":"https://appstoreconnect.apple.com","line":285},{"title":"App Clip Code Generator","target":"https://developer.apple.com/app-clips/resources/","line":285},{"title":"Four App Clip badges, each using different colors. The two on the left use the badge design, and the two on the right use the design without the App Clip logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/02d96548534ce28b92754477aadbf9bb/app-clips-customizing%402x.png","line":287,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an invalid App Clip Code with a changed aspect ratio.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2243d4c0011526cae9bd3d69e62907ae/customizing-wrong-1%402x.png","line":291,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate an invalid App Clip Code.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":293,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an invalid App Clip Code with a color gradient instead of a solid background color.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/publi